/**
 * Playwright e2e configuration.
 *
 * Runs the real app (Vite dev server) and drives it through the browser:
 * loading sample SCORM packages via the drop zone, verifying the manifest
 * tree, the persistent player iframe (served through the service worker),
 * live CMI updates, and Basic ↔ Advanced mode switches.
 *
 * The e2e fixtures in `e2e/fixtures/` are committed, generated by
 * `scripts/make-fixtures.mjs` (jszip) so CI never needs to build them.
 */

